type: software
title: scigantic-surechembl
abstract: "SureChEMBL patent chemistry from Python: compounds by id, name, SMILES or InChIKey, structure search, patents by compound, full-text search and full patent documents with their extracted chemistry. Reads EBI's bulk parquet releases in place with DuckDB and joins into scigantic-chembl, scigantic-bindingdb and scigantic-pubchem."
authors:
  - name: Scigantic
    website: https://scigantic.com
repository-code: https://github.com/Scigantic/scigantic-surechembl
url: https://pypi.org/project/scigantic-surechembl/
license: MIT-0
keywords:
